# Coleção da demo ponta a ponta (roteiro em docs/demo/README.md).
# Formato do VS Code REST Client: rode as requisições na ordem, de cima para baixo.
# As requisições com "# @name" guardam a resposta para as seguintes (ex.: o token).

@keycloak = http://localhost:8085/realms/omni-market/protocol/openid-connect/token
@bff = http://localhost:8080
@catalog = http://localhost:8082
@kafkaUi = http://localhost:8090/api/clusters/omni-market
@clientId = bff-gateway
# O client secret é gerado pelo `make env`: copie o valor de BFF_CLIENT_SECRET do .env da raiz para cá.
@clientSecret = COLE_AQUI_O_BFF_CLIENT_SECRET_DO_ENV

### Ato 1: token do admin (papéis admin e customer)
# @name admin
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&username=admin&password=admin

### Ato 1: token do customer (só o papel customer)
# @name customer
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}&username=customer&password=customer

### Ato 1: sem token, o BFF responde 401
POST {{bff}}/catalog/import/xlsx
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="catalog-demo.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./catalog-demo.xlsx
--demo--

### Ato 1: com o customer, o BFF responde 403 (importar exige o papel admin)
POST {{bff}}/catalog/import/xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="catalog-demo.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./catalog-demo.xlsx
--demo--

### Ato 2: importação da planilha pelo BFF com o admin: {"importedProducts":5}
POST {{bff}}/catalog/import/xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="catalog-demo.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./catalog-demo.xlsx
--demo--

### Ato 3: aprovado pelo compliance
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/OXI-001

### Ato 3: aprovado pelo compliance
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/MON-002

### Ato 3: reprovado por termo proibido ("réplica")
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/EST-003

### Ato 3: reprovado por preço acima do teto (100.000)
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/RES-004

### Ato 3: reprovado por descrição curta (menos de 20 caracteres)
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/LUV-005

### Ato 4 (plano B: pedido publicado à mão): venda de 1 OXI-001, estoque 2 → 1, catalog.stock.reserved.v1
POST {{kafkaUi}}/topics/order.order.placed.v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partition": 0,
  "keySerde": "String",
  "valueSerde": "String",
  "key": "6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "value": "{\"orderId\":\"6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"OXI-001\",\"quantity\":1}]}"
}

### Ato 4: confere o estoque (1)
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/OXI-001

### Ato 4: falta estoque, pede 2 com 1 disponível; nada muda, catalog.stock.insufficient.v1
POST {{kafkaUi}}/topics/order.order.placed.v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partition": 0,
  "keySerde": "String",
  "valueSerde": "String",
  "key": "6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "value": "{\"orderId\":\"6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000002\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"OXI-001\",\"quantity\":2}]}"
}

### Ato 4: produto reprovado não pode ser vendido (available 0), catalog.stock.insufficient.v1
POST {{kafkaUi}}/topics/order.order.placed.v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partition": 0,
  "keySerde": "String",
  "valueSerde": "String",
  "key": "6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "value": "{\"orderId\":\"6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000003\",\"items\":[{\"sku\":\"EST-003\",\"quantity\":1}]}"
}

### Ato 4: cancelamento do primeiro pedido devolve o estoque (1 → 2), catalog.product.stock-changed.v1
POST {{kafkaUi}}/topics/order.order.cancelled.v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partition": 0,
  "keySerde": "String",
  "valueSerde": "String",
  "key": "6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "value": "{\"orderId\":\"6f1c2b8e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\",\"reason\":\"PAYMENT_FAILED\"}"
}

### Ato 4: confere o estoque (2)
GET {{catalog}}/products/sku/OXI-001
